* input.device in the C900 dialect of an Amiga fd file, from AROS's
* input.conf.  Each function takes InputBase first; the C functions are
* AROS_LH definitions named Input_N after their vector.
##base _InputBase
##bias 30
##private
BeginIO(ioRequest)(struct IORequest *) void @Input_5
AbortIO(ioRequest)(struct IORequest *) LONG @Input_6
##public
PeekQualifier()() UWORD @Input_7
##end
